---
// Numbers from the 51Labs student project "Thematic Narrative Portfolio Engine (Alpha 6.8)" and its technical
// report (18 April 2026), HOSE, weekly rebalanced, 0.15% fee per trade. All figures are the report's own
// backtest results, in-sample, as the report says in its Limitations table.
const W = 900;
const H = 380;
const rows = [
  { id: 'idx', en: 'VN-Index', vi: 'VN-Index', ret: 32.0, sh: 0.99, dd: 18.11, cls: 'idx' },
  { id: '68', en: 'Alpha 6.8', vi: 'Alpha 6.8', ret: 31.91, sh: 1.01, dd: 21.28, cls: 'a68' },
  { id: '69', en: 'Alpha 6.9', vi: 'Alpha 6.9', ret: 37.78, sh: 1.13, dd: 21.15, cls: 'tuned' },
  { id: '70', en: 'Alpha 7.0', vi: 'Alpha 7.0', ret: 40.05, sh: 1.17, dd: 21.05, cls: 'tuned' },
];
const cols = [
  { x: 190, key: 'ret', maxV: 45, en: 'Total return, %', vi: 'Tổng lợi nhuận, %', f: (v: number) => v.toFixed(2) },
  { x: 460, key: 'sh', maxV: 1.4, en: 'Sharpe ratio', vi: 'Hệ số Sharpe', f: (v: number) => v.toFixed(2) },
  { x: 690, key: 'dd', maxV: 25, en: 'Max drawdown, %', vi: 'Sụt giảm tối đa, %', f: (v: number) => '−' + v.toFixed(2) },
] as const;
const BARW = 150;
---
<figure class="p17f">
  <div class="p17f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Backtest results of a Vietnamese news-narrative strategy from a 51Labs student project, against the VN-Index. Alpha 6.8 returned 31.91 percent with Sharpe 1.01 and maximum drawdown 21.28 percent, while the VN-Index returned 32.00 percent with Sharpe 0.99 and drawdown 18.11 percent. Two later versions with parameters tuned on the same period report 37.78 and 40.05 percent.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="p17f-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A news-driven strategy on HOSE, as its own report shows it</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một chiến lược chạy theo tin trên HOSE, đúng như báo cáo của chính nó</tspan>
    </text>
    {cols.map((c) => (
      <text x={c.x} y="66" class="p17f-col">
        <tspan data-lang-en>{c.en}</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.vi}</tspan>
      </text>
    ))}
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x="14" y={80 + i * 54} width="872" height="46" rx="6" class={`p17f-band ${r.cls === 'a68' ? 'is-key' : ''}`} />
        <text x="26" y={109 + i * 54} class={`p17f-name ${r.cls === 'a68' ? 'is-key' : ''}`}>
          <tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
        {cols.map((c) => {
          const v = (r as any)[c.key] as number;
          const w = Math.max(2, (v / c.maxV) * BARW);
          return (
            <g>
              <rect x={c.x} y={92 + i * 54} width={w} height="22" rx="3" class={`p17f-bar is-${r.cls} ${c.key === 'dd' ? 'is-dd' : ''}`} />
              <text x={c.x + w + 8} y={109 + i * 54} class="p17f-val">
                <tspan data-lang-en>{c.f(v)}</tspan>
                <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.f(v).replace('.', ',')}</tspan>
              </text>
            </g>
          );
        })}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="26" y="318" class="p17f-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>6.9 and 7.0 re-tune stock count, signal weights, volume floor and turnover threshold on the same period. The report lists "in-sample only" as a limit.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>6.9 và 7.0 chỉnh lại số mã, trọng số, ngưỡng khối lượng và ngưỡng đảo danh mục trên cùng giai đoạn. Báo cáo nêu "chỉ trong mẫu" là hạn chế.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="26" y="340" class="p17f-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The report's weekly appendix starts on 26 Aug 2024; the stated 31.91% total and 19.20% CAGR imply about 1.6 years.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phụ lục theo tuần của báo cáo bắt đầu từ 26/8/2024; tổng 31,91% và CAGR 19,20% ngụ ý khoảng 1,6 năm.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Source: Vo Tran Huong Giang, "Thematic Narrative Portfolio Engine", technical report, 18 April 2026 (a 51Labs student project). These are the report's backtest numbers, not live results.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nguồn: Vo Tran Huong Giang, "Thematic Narrative Portfolio Engine", báo cáo kỹ thuật, 18/4/2026 (dự án học viên 51Labs). Đây là số backtest trong báo cáo, không phải kết quả chạy thật.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p17f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p17f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p17f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p17f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p17f .p17f-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17f .p17f-col { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17f .p17f-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17f .p17f-name.is-key { font-weight: 700; }
  .p17f .p17f-val { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17f .p17f-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17f-band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p17f-band.is-key { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .p17f-bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17f-bar.is-a68 { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p17f-bar.is-tuned { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .p17f-bar.is-dd { fill: var(--red); opacity: 0.8; }
  .p17f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
